# Deferred: mass when already open in Creo

Silent Collect does **not** gather mass: Creo.JS leaves `GetMassProperty` unbound on RetrieveModel / undisplayed session handles. Do not re-add silent mass attempts or Display/OpenFile/CreateModelWindow during Collect.

## Later idea (not implemented)

When a model is **already open/displayed** in Creo (active window / bound solid), Collect (or check-in metadata) can call `GetMassProperty` on that handle without opening anything. Reuse `GetActiveModel` / `CurrentModel` when same file and solid methods are bound.

- Only fills mass for models the user already has open
- Does not solve batch Collect for thousands of closed files
- Confirm once on a displayed part before wiring broadly

Mass tab / API can still store mass if a client posts it; Collect simply omits mass today.
